# L §5.12: "Supply and demand share one unit" (LOAD-UNIT).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

index payers = [ewa, jan]
input sup[p in payers]: money PLN
input cap: num

fill pool
  supply sup[p] for p in payers
  demand cap
  arc true
  order 0
=== expect
refused: LOAD-UNIT ...
